icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/113.0.5672.127/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"a0e0cc67b1af9ee6b561b5a29ef94247e496ad085967ab708f92461e7eeb47ee"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/113.0.5672.127/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"03714c6964ad024c631c26ded7acdf261d91d383975c92a0c83a0d4d4e83a366"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/113.0.5672.127/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"dd9976741285450853e9ed69bdc9817f483af19b0a9dd456fab7a879df72e5e5"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"113.0.5672.127"}